**Generar prevalencia NO FIES / SI FIES (Rangos FAO)

WEIGHT OFF.

FILTER OFF.
USE ALL.
EXECUTE.

COMPUTE P_NO_FIES_pct_FAO=100-(P_grave_pct_FAO + P_moderada_pct_FAO).
EXECUTE.


COMPUTE P_FIES_pct_FAO=P_moderada_mas_pct_FAO.
VARIABLE LABELS  P_FIES_pct_FAO 'Prevalencia inseguridad alimentaria FAO (Algún nivel de '+
    'inseguridad)'.
EXECUTE.

COMPUTE Comprobar=P_FIES_pct_FAO + P_NO_FIES_pct_FAO.
VARIABLE LABELS  Comprobar 'Comprobar'.
EXECUTE.

*Comprobación debe ser  == 100

DESCRIPTIVES VARIABLES=Comprobar
  /STATISTICS=MEAN STDDEV MIN MAX.

DELETE VARIABLES Comprobar. 


WEIGHT BY peso.



