VARIABLE LABELS  P_FIES_pct_OVI 'Prevalencia FIES Rangos OVI (cualqueir nivel de FIES)'.
EXECUTE.


COMPUTE Comprobar=P_FIES_pct_OVI + P_NO_FIES_pct_OVI.
VARIABLE LABELS  Comprobar 'Comprobar'.
EXECUTE.

*Comprobación debe ser  == 100

